  "description": "Exhausted from work, Yu-Young reluctantly followed his boss up the mountain. There, he was unexpectedly kidnapped by the mountain god, a tiger deity who rules the mountain.\n\n *“From today, you are my husband.”*\n\nHe attempts to escape failed time and again, and Yu-Young began to be swayed by the mountain god, San-Ho's, unexpected side...! \n\nWill the two of them be able to hold their wedding?\n\n(Source: Ridibooks, translated)",
